  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1203.85 Publication rotogravure printing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1203.85 \"Publication rotogravure printing\" means rotogravure printing on paper which is subsequently formed into books, magazines, catalogues, brochures, directories, newspaper supplements, pamphlets, periodicals, direct mail advertisements, display advertisements, and other printed materials.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
